    <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Knowledge_Organization_System>;
    skos:definition
        "knowledge organization system that provides a curated list of authorized forms of names or terms to ensure consistency.";
    skos:prefLabel "Authority File";
    <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#is_subclass_of>
    <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Knowledge_Organization_System>.
<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Blank_Node>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
    "naming concept representing an anonymous resource without a global ID.";
