<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Data_Service>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "semantic modeling component providing the method and technology for making semantic data available to users and applications, encompassing storage systems, query interfaces, and protocols.";
