<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Naming_Concept>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "semantic modeling component providing a system for uniquely identifying and organizing resources on the web and in semantic models, including URIs and namespaces.";
    rdfs:isDefinedBy ont:545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06;
