    <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Linking_Property>.
<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#narrowMatch>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "linking property indicating that one concept is narrower in meaning than another across different concept schemes.";
