    <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Graph_Concept>.
<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#related>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "linking property indicating that two concepts are associated in meaning within the same concept scheme.";
