<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Taxonomy>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "knowledge organization system that provides a hierarchical classification system organizing concepts into parent-child relationships.";
    rdfs:isDefinedBy ont:545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06;
