<545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Upper_Ontology>
    a owl:Class, skos:Concept;
    rdfs:comment
        "ontology that defines very general, domain-independent concepts like object, event, time, and space to provide a foundation for integration.";
    rdfs:isDefinedBy ont:545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06;
    rdfs:label "Upper Ontology";
    rdfs:subClassOf <545fd378-f141-21a6-42e3-ba868aff0f06#Ontology>;
